    crm:P67i_is_referred_to_by [ a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
            crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "Small, reddish-brown flower bud of the tropical evergreen tree Syzygium aromaticum. It yields oil which is used as an antiseptic and a flavoring, and is dried and ground into an aromatic spice. The ground flower is also used as a means of organic pest control. [Source: Getty AAT]" ;
